ddx
------------------------------------------
Domain decomposition continuum solvation library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libddx-devel-1.0.2-1bl1
  libddx1-1.0.2-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  liblapack-devel-3.12.0-1
  liblapack0-3.12.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  liblapack-devel-3.12.0-1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ddsolvation/ddX

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ddsolvation/ddX/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ddx-1.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ddx-1.0.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ddx-1.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ddx-1.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libddx1-1.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libddx-devel-1.0.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

